{{Quote|If you want to go to the mines, be my guest. They're beneath the civic center in the city of Sundari.|Bo-Katan Kryze to Din Djarin|<ref name="Chapter 17" />}}
The '''Civic Center''',<ref name="Chapter 18">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 18: The Mines of Mandalore}}</ref> also written as '''civic center''', was located in the [[city]] of [[Sundari]] on [[Mandalore]], above the [[Mines of Mandalore]] and the [[Living Waters]].<ref name="Chapter 17" /> It was heavily damaged during the [[Great Purge of Mandalore]].<ref name="Chapter 18" />

